algorithms.pseudocode:
Input: Matrix A in R^{n x n}, ciphertext y in R^n
Output: All valid (x, sigma) pairs

for each permutation sigma in S_n:
    for j = 1 to n:
        x[j] = y[sigma^{-1}(j)] - A[sigma^{-1}(j), j]
    if TropicalEncode(A, x) == y and BoundedOscillation(x, delta):
        output (x, sigma)

Complexity: O(n! * n^2) time
